# Template for contracts/script/v2/DeployV2.s.sol. No environment configuration is required.
# Keep keystores and password files outside the repository.
# The deployer is the script's sender (--sender, or the only signer).
# It sends exactly three consecutive transactions on its protocol nonce: Venue implementation, Settler,
# and VenueFactory. The factory address is predicted from the starting nonce. Send nothing else from
# the deployer during the run. REGISTRY_ADMIN is retired: nonzero values are rejected.
